"text":"afterwards does not change it. When a graph has several embeddings, which one is returned is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not specified, but it depends only on the graph’s rows: graphs with the same vertices, the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge positions and the same incidence order get the same embedding."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighbors","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/Faces-swift.struct"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faceCount","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faces-swift.property"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(safe:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighborIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(safe:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/face(from:alongEdgeAt:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"references":{"doc://Planarity/s9EscapableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/s9EscapableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Escapable"},"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity/PlanarEmbedding/clockwiseIncidentEdges(of:)":{"identifier"